  Hi #{@user.username},

  This is a final reminder that Nitrous Lite will be shut down completely on July 30, 2015.

  You have #{@boxes.size} remaining #{'box'.pluralize(@boxes.size)} on Nitrous Lite: #{@boxes.to_sentence}

  The above #{'box'.pluralize(@boxes.size)} will be terminated and no longer be available upon the shutdown of Nitrous Lite.

  To assist with the transition, we're offering a limited-time #{@disc}% discount on Nitrous Pro plans for the first month.
  Make sure to claim the coupon and create your new Nitrous Pro workspace before it expires on July 18th!

  [#{@coupon_url}](#{@coupon_url})

  We believe strongly in data portability, so we have prepared documentation on
  how to preserve your data at

  [https://community.nitrous.io/docs/backing-up-your-nitrous-lite-data](https://community.nitrous.io/docs/backing-up-your-nitrous-lite-data).

  If you have any questions or need any help at all, please get in touch at [support@nitrous.io](mailto:support@nitrous.io).
  We hope to see you on [Nitrous Pro](https://pro.nitrous.io) soon!

  Cheers,<br>
  The Nitrous Team
